OL,3,ATributes paid to 'giant' of Irish
OL,4,Atraditional music scene
OL,5,
OL,6,FA renowned traditional Irish musician
OL,7,Fand educator who died following a road
OL,8,Fcrash in County Armagh has been
OL,9,Fdescribed by a Sinn Fein MP as a "giant
OL,10,Fof Irish cultural life".
OL,12,FEithne Vallely, 81, who was originally
OL,13,Ffrom Donegal, died following a road
OL,14,Ftraffic collision on the Portadown Road
OL,15,Fin Armagh on Friday morning.
OL,17,FDaire Hughes said her decades of
OL,18,Fcontribution to music and cultural
OL,19,Fexpression "cannot be overstated" and
OL,20,Fis "evidenced by her countless awards
OL,21,Fand honours".
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,180,160,200,105,0,100
