OL,3,ATributes paid to 'giant' of Irish
OL,4,Atraditional music scene
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe added that she was "tremendously
OL,7,Fgifted" and passed her passion for
OL,8,Fmusic on to her family and the wider
OL,9,Fcommunity through the founding of the
OL,10,FArmagh Pipers Club with her husband,
OL,11,FBrian.
